sigreg-triton
Copyright 2026 Gonzalo Fuentes

This product implements SIGReg (Sketched Isotropic Gaussian Regularization) with the
sliced Epps-Pulley statistic, as described in:

  Randall Balestriero and Yann LeCun. "LeJEPA: Provable and Scalable Self-Supervised
  Learning Without the Heuristics". arXiv:2511.08544, 2025.

The mathematical definition (integration grid, quadrature weights, normalization,
distributed all-reduce semantics and direction sampling) follows the official LeJEPA
code at https://github.com/galilai-group/lejepa (commit c293d291). No source code from
that repository is included here; the official package is only installed, unmodified,
as an optional test/benchmark dependency.
